  (lib_symbols)
  (text "solbot_main v2 rev B - compact ESP32-S3 main controller, JLCPCB basic parts\n\nESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 GPIO map\n  ADC1: POS A1..A4 = GPIO1, 2, 3, 4   IS A1..A4 = GPIO5, 6, 7, 8   BUS_VS = GPIO9   V12_SNS = GPIO10\n  PWM R/L (active-low into 74HC14): A1 = 11/12  A2 = 13/14  A3 = 15/16  A4 = 17/18\n  I2C (BNO085 0x4A): SDA = 41, SCL = 42      IMU_INT = 20, IMU_RST = 19\n  SSR1 (PV) = GPIO21   SSR2 = GPIO47   ACT_EN = 39 (through E-stop loop)   ESTOP_SENSE = 40   LED_ERR = 46\n\nIBT-2 IDC 2x5 (v3 pinout): 1 RPWM 2 LPWM 3 R_EN 4 L_EN (EN5 = E-stop gate) 5 R_IS 6 L_IS 7 VCC(+5V) 8 GND 9/10 n.c.\nPV switch: two DELIXI CDG1-1DD/25A DC SSRs, outputs in series back-to-back (- to -).\nThrough-hole parts are hand-soldered (not in the JLC assembly BOM).\n"
